 ('bb-moo-source','BB MoO3 trace stock lost subscript and hierarchy','https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureMech/issues/674',lambda d:d['source']['source_label']=='MoO','CCAP explicitly supplies MoO3 in trace stock 7 and doses that stock separately. Correct source transcription and stage, not a global MoO alias.'),
